From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Denk <tim.denk@zymtrace.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:07:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] add the x86_64-unknown-muffin target

muffin userspace builds std on the unix PAL. The spec mirrors the JSON
target in bazel/toolchains/spec.bzl of muffin-os/muffin key by key.

